  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "regeln",
   "x": 230,
   "y": 433,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 81,
   "text": "1 · 2-minute rule only when capturing, never in the morning\n2 · at least 2 of the 6 daily slots go to Q2\n3 · unfinished tasks move up, no blame\n4 · Q3 and Q4 never enter the daily plan\n5 · carried over 3×: tiny step instead of an endless loop",
   "originalText": "1 · 2-minute rule only when capturing, never in the morning\n2 · at least 2 of the 6 daily slots go to Q2\n3 · unfinished tasks move up, no blame\n4 · Q3 and Q4 never enter the daily plan\n5 · carried over 3×: tiny step instead of an endless loop",
