   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🌙 Quick look back: what did you get done?\n1. 🐸 Call the insurance · 3. Call the bank\n\n📅 »Renew passport« is due in 4 days – move to Q1?\n🐸 »Call the insurance« has been carried over 3 times.\nTiniest first step: look up the contract number?\n\nPlan for tomorrow: 1. 🐸 … – OK? (e.g. »1 done, OK«)",
   "originalText": "🌙 Quick look back: what did you get done?\n1. 🐸 Call the insurance · 3. Call the bank\n\n📅 »Renew passport« is due in 4 days – move to Q1?\n🐸 »Call the insurance« has been carried over 3 times.\nTiniest first step: look up the contract number?\n\nPlan for tomorrow: 1. 🐸 … – OK? (e.g. »1 done, OK«)",
