   "locked": false,
   "text": "The code counts days, carry-overs and deadlines – locally, offline. The AI never counts itself; it only decides what to say.\nOptionally, Jev (TypeSafe) estimates »important?« and »urgent?«: einsortieren · zwei_minuten · rangfolge.",
